  "description": "As a child, Sasha Laurent lost her parents overnight when the Dochen Republic invaded and burned her hometown, Neroi. Fleeing across the border, she lived off the streets until rescued by General Gerard of the Allied Forces. A decade later, when he asks her to infiltrate Dochen as a secret agent, she has no choice but to comply, but soon finds herself a prisoner at the mercy of Major General Johann von Willendorf. Sasha’s unhealthy obsession with Johann veers dangerously close to love, but will her feelings change when he makes her a double agent?\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 3 side stories.*",
